# Cartonium — general

- Product: Cartonis boardgame club app (Nuxt 4 + local Postgres/Drizzle + Better Auth + Vuetify).
- Read `AGENTS.md` and `CODE_MAP.md` before non-trivial changes; deep docs in `docs/`.
- Preserve architecture: server APIs own DB via `#server/db`; auth via Better Auth (`#server/utils/auth`, `useAuthUser`); `server/transformers.ts` maps snake↔camel (`*FromDb`); UI types in `shared/types/frontend.ts`.
- State: Nuxt `useState` only (`club`, `clubPermissions`, `lastGathering`, `lastGatheringName`) — no Pinia.
- Prefer smallest diff; match local style; no drive-by refactors.
- Never invent DB fields or business rules; check `server/db/schema/` and existing APIs (`supabase/migrations/` is legacy).
- Do not commit secrets (`.env`, `creds.json`) or generated i18n JSON / `.generated/*`.
- Telegram bots are disabled in `server/plugins/telegram-bots-starter.ts` — leave disabled unless asked.
- Vitest DB unit tests under `tests/` (`npm test`); still smoke with `npm run dev` / `npm run build` for risky changes.
